   "item": "𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀𠀀a",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "a byte order mark is no white space",
   "item": "x\ufeff",
   "valid": true
  },
  {
   "name": "empty",
   "item": "",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "a space",
   "item": "a b",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "a tab",
   "item": "a\tb",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "an ideographic space",
   "item": "未\u3000末",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "a no-break space",
   "item": "\u00a0x",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "a line separator",
   "item": "x\u2028",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "a control character",
   "item": "x\u0007",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "a C1 control character",
   "item": "x\u0085",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "DEL",
   "item": "x\u007f",
   "valid": false
  },
  {
   "name": "not a string",
   "item": 12,
   "valid": false
  }
 ],
 "build": [
  {
   "name": "an answer names the item, the mode and the grade, in this member order",
   "drill": "tone-pairs",
   "item": "3-4",
   "mode": "produce",
   "grade": 3,
   "expect": {
    "type": "drill.tone-pairs",
    "payload": {
     "item": "3-4",
     "mode": "produce",
     "grade": 3
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "a word and form family, recognised, Again",
   "drill": "conjugation",
   "item": "1234:past-negative-polite",
   "mode": "recognise",
   "grade": 1,
   "expect": {
    "type": "drill.conjugation",
    "payload": {
     "item": "1234:past-negative-polite",
     "mode": "recognise",
     "grade": 1
    }
   }
  }
 ],
 "parse": [
  {
   "name": "an answer",
   "event": {
    "id": "01KB00000000000000000D0001",
    "workspaceId": 7,
    "device": "web",
    "ts": "2026-11-28T08:00:00Z",
    "type": "drill.tone-pairs",
    "payload": {
     "item": "3-4",
     "mode": "produce",
     "grade": 3
    }
   },
   "expect": {
    "drill": "tone-pairs",
    "item": "3-4",
    "mode": "produce",
    "grade": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "members a drill adds after these are ignored",
   "event": {
    "id": "01KB00000000000000000D0002",
    "workspaceId": 7,
    "device": "web",
    "ts": "2026-11-28T08:00:00Z",
    "type": "drill.look-alikes",
    "payload": {
     "item": "未末",
     "mode": "choose",
     "grade": 1,
     "given": "末"
    }
   },
   "expect": {
    "drill": "look-alikes",
    "item": "未末",
    "mode": "choose",
    "grade": 1
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "a drill this client has not registered is still an answer",
   "event": {
    "id": "01KB00000000000000000D0003",
    "workspaceId": 7,
    "device": "web",
    "ts": "2026-11-28T08:00:00Z",
    "type": "drill.future-drill",
    "payload": {
     "item": "x",
     "mode": "produce",
     "grade": 4
    }
   },
   "expect": {
    "drill": "future-drill",
    "item": "x",
    "mode": "produce",
    "grade": 4
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "every grade from 1 to 4",
   "event": {
    "id": "01KB00000000000000000D0004",
    "workspaceId": 7,
    "device": "web",
    "ts": "2026-11-28T08:00:00Z",
    "type": "drill.counters",
    "payload": {
     "item": "5678",
     "mode": "produce",
     "grade": 2
    }
   },
   "expect": {
